{"unit_id":"Aztech-Lab__dsh-3301#feature-1","repo":"Aztech-Lab/dsh-3301","commit":"09856b2fa4150546aa32d7508891ebbafe2923fd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-3301 的功能「局域网代理」：插件按设置绑定监听地址和端口，并将 HTTP 请求转发给本机 DSH 服务。 通过 DSH 设置卡片配置或在网页登录时触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/plugin.js:618-670"]}
{"unit_id":"Aztech-Lab__dsh-3301#feature-2","repo":"Aztech-Lab/dsh-3301","commit":"09856b2fa4150546aa32d7508891ebbafe2923fd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-3301 的功能「WebSocket 转发」：浏览器建立 WebSocket 升级连接时，插件将连接代理到本机 DSH 上游。 通过 DSH 设置卡片配置或在网页登录时触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/plugin.js:640-660"]}
{"unit_id":"Aztech-Lab__dsh-3301#feature-3","repo":"Aztech-Lab/dsh-3301","commit":"09856b2fa4150546aa32d7508891ebbafe2923fd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-3301 的功能「可选口令门禁」：用户可在本机首次设置口令；启用后网页请求先经过登录并使用会话 cookie。 通过 DSH 设置卡片配置或在网页登录时触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/plugin.js:419-500"]}
{"unit_id":"Aztech-Lab__dsh-3301#feature-4","repo":"Aztech-Lab/dsh-3301","commit":"09856b2fa4150546aa32d7508891ebbafe2923fd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-3301 的功能「设置卡片」：插件在 DSH 设置页注册卡片，可编辑监听、会话期限、失败次数和锁定时长等配置。 通过 DSH 设置卡片配置或在网页登录时触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/plugin.js:464-475"]}
